authoring_notes = "Step 7C S003 draft. Evacuation Relay authority test: the convoy officer proposes/orders a tactically understandable pursuit; Cyanis explicitly refuses because wounded soldiers/civilians remain exposed, pursuit would split damaged defenders, and abandoning wreckage/recovery cargo would surrender control of the field. His argument is grounded in S002 evidence, especially the deliberately clean northern cut. The officer remains credible and redirects the force after evaluating the evidence. Ilyra arrival and damaged Card response remain S004. No proof portrait asset is promoted into canon."
beats = [{
