"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 450, "staging": "Cyanis reaches the Evacuation Relay after S002. The structure is damaged but usable as a protected casualty collection point. Survivors move toward it along the stone-line route established in S002; the recovery wagon and broken convoy remain visible farther back.", "camera": "Readable wide linking relay, survivor route, wreck field, and northern cut.", "movement": "Cyanis enters the relay perimeter and checks the incoming survivor line.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["RESUME_AFTER_S002", "CINEMATIC_WORLD_BEAT"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S003_B002",
"speaker_id": "",
"text": "",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 260, "staging": "Cyanis counts visible survivors, able escorts, and the distance between relay, wreckage, and recovery wagon. He does not receive supernatural information; all assessment is line-of-sight and prior field knowledge.", "camera": "Short observational inserts: survivors entering relay perimeter, damaged escort line, recovery wagon, northern cut.", "movement": "None.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["CINEMATIC_WORLD_BEAT", "FIELD_COUNT", "NATURAL_BATTLEFIELD_AWARENESS"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S003_B003",
"speaker_id": "convoy_superior_officer",
"text": "Report.",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 35, "staging": "The officer arrives from the wreck field while still tracking the northern withdrawal.", "camera": "Medium two-shot.", "movement": "Officer stops beside Cyanis, not in front of him theatrically.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S003_B004",
"speaker_id": "cyanis",
"text": "Seventeen moving. Five need carrying. Two escorts can still fight cleanly. Three more can hold a fixed line.",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 55, "staging": "Cyanis gives only the field count he can support from observation and the work already done in S002.", "camera": "Hold two-shot with survivor movement in background.", "movement": "None.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE", "FIELD_COUNT"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S003_B005",
"speaker_id": "convoy_superior_officer",
"text": "Recovery wagon?",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 30, "staging": "Immediate operational question.", "camera": "Brief sightline toward the convoy center.", "movement": "None.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S003_B006",
"speaker_id": "cyanis",
"text": "Still ours. East approach is open. Center road isn't safe for the wounded.",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 45, "staging": "He separates cargo control from casualty movement rather than collapsing both into one problem.", "camera": "Keep wreckage and survivor route geographically legible.", "movement": "None.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE", "FIELD_CONTROL_READ"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S003_B007",
"speaker_id": "convoy_superior_officer",
"text": "North side is still withdrawing.",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 35, "staging": "The officer watches the opportunity rather than dismissing the casualty picture.", "camera": "Over-shoulder toward the northern cut.", "movement": "None.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S003_B008",
"speaker_id": "cyanis",
"text": "I know.",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 45, "staging": "No argument yet. Cyanis keeps watching the same ground.", "camera": "Hold shared sightline.", "movement": "None.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S003_B009",
"speaker_id": "convoy_superior_officer",
"text": "If they reach the ridge intact, they regroup and hit us again.",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 45, "staging": "The pursuit rationale is legitimate: a retreating hostile force may re-form and renew the attack.", "camera": "Officer remains focused on the north route, not framed as reckless or cruel.", "movement": "None.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE", "PURSUIT_RATIONALE"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S003_B010",
"speaker_id": "convoy_superior_officer",
"text": "Take everyone who can still move fast. Drive them north before they settle.",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 70, "staging": "A direct pursuit order based on the apparent retreat. The officer believes speed may prevent another attack.", "camera": "Medium two-shot; no villain framing.", "movement": "Officer starts to indicate the northern cut.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE", "PURSUIT_ORDER_GIVEN"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S003_B011",
"speaker_id": "cyanis",
"text": "No, sir. We don't have the line for it.",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 120, "staging": "The refusal is quiet, formal, and immediate. Cyanis does not raise his voice or turn the moment into a challenge of status.", "camera": "Hold on Cyanis without heroic push-in.", "movement": "Cyanis remains facing the field.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE", "AUTHORED_PURSUIT_REFUSAL"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S003_B012",
"speaker_id": "convoy_superior_officer",
"text": "Dovaren.",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "staging": "A warning and request for clarity, not theatrical outrage.", "camera": "Return to two-shot.", "movement": "None.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S003_B013",
"speaker_id": "cyanis",
"text": "The wounded and civilians are still exposed. Five people cannot move without help.",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 50, "staging": "First required tactical reason: exposed wounded and civilians. Cyanis points toward the survivor line only if needed; he does not sentimentalize the fact.", "camera": "Include survivors crossing into the relay perimeter.", "movement": "None.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE", "REFUSAL_REASON_EXPOSED_SURVIVORS"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S003_B014",
"speaker_id": "convoy_superior_officer",
"text": "We leave a guard here.",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 40, "staging": "The officer tests whether a reduced holding force solves the problem.", "camera": "Hold.", "movement": "None.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S003_B015",
"speaker_id": "cyanis",
"text": "Then we split damaged defenders between two fights.",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 45, "staging": "Second required tactical reason: pursuit divides the already damaged defense.", "camera": "Brief composition linking relay defenders and northern cut.", "movement": "None.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE", "REFUSAL_REASON_SPLIT_DEFENDERS"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S003_B016",
"speaker_id": "convoy_superior_officer",
"text": "If they are running, there isn't a second fight.",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 55, "staging": "The officer presses the key uncertainty rather than conceding immediately.", "camera": "Shared look toward the retreat.", "movement": "None.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S003_B017",
"speaker_id": "cyanis",
"text": "If they're running, we lose nothing by holding ten minutes. If they're baiting us, we lose the field by chasing now.",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 70, "staging": "Cyanis frames the uncertainty as asymmetric risk rather than pretending he knows the enemy intent.", "camera": "Keep northern cut and wreck field in the same geographic logic.", "movement": "None.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE", "BAIT_RISK_ARGUMENT"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S003_B018",
"speaker_id": "convoy_superior_officer",
"text": "You're basing that on the cut.",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 40, "staging": "The officer identifies Cyanis's evidence from S002.", "camera": "North cut insert.", "movement": "None.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S003_B019",
"speaker_id": "cyanis",
"text": "The cut, the blocked center, and where they left pressure. They opened one direction for us and closed the rest.",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 55, "staging": "He cites observable S002 evidence, not intuition dressed as certainty.", "camera": "Three quick readable field inserts matching each observation.", "movement": "None.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE", "S002_EVIDENCE_RECALLED", "NATURAL_BATTLEFIELD_AWARENESS"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S003_B020",
"speaker_id": "convoy_superior_officer",
"text": "And the recovery wagon?",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 35, "staging": "The officer asks what holding means for the mission cargo.", "camera": "Sightline toward the recovery wagon.", "movement": "None.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S003_B021",
"speaker_id": "cyanis",
"text": "We leave the wreckage and recovery wagon behind a pursuit, we surrender control of the whole field. They only have to turn around before we do.",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 75, "staging": "Third required tactical reason: abandoning wreckage and cargo gives up field control. Cyanis keeps the logic operational rather than mystical or artifact-reverent.", "camera": "Hold geographic line from relay through wreckage to recovery wagon.", "movement": "None.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE", "REFUSAL_REASON_FIELD_AND_CARGO_CONTROL"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S003_B022",
"speaker_id": "convoy_superior_officer",
"text": "So your recommendation is to let them walk.",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 45, "staging": "The officer states the cost plainly; this is not a trick question.", "camera": "Two-shot.", "movement": "None.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S003_B023",
"speaker_id": "cyanis",
"text": "My recommendation is that we keep what we still have.",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 55, "staging": "Cyanis refuses the framing that inaction equals surrender; he centers surviving force, people, cargo, and ground.", "camera": "Hold.", "movement": "None.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S003_B024",
"speaker_id": "convoy_superior_officer",
"text": "Spell it out.",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 35, "staging": "The officer asks for the executable alternative, showing willingness to evaluate rather than demand obedience for its own sake.", "camera": "Hold.", "movement": "None.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S003_B025",
"speaker_id": "cyanis",
"text": "Move every casualty to the relay. Re-form the escorts around the wreck and recovery wagon. Watch north, but don't feed anyone into that cut.",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 65, "staging": "The alternative is concrete and immediately actionable.", "camera": "Show relay, wreck line, wagon, then north watch direction as each part is named.", "movement": "None.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE", "PROTECTIVE_TACTICAL_COURSE"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S003_B026",
"speaker_id": "convoy_superior_officer",
"text": "And if they reform anyway?",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 40, "staging": "Final pressure test of Cyanis's plan.", "camera": "Hold.", "movement": "None.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S003_B027",
"speaker_id": "cyanis",
"text": "Then they come back to a line instead of finding our backs.",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 100, "staging": "Short conclusion. No claim that the plan is risk-free.", "camera": "Hold two-shot, survivor movement continuing behind them.", "movement": "None.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S003_B028",
"speaker_id": "",
"text": "",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 420, "staging": "The officer looks north, then back across the actual field: exposed casualty movement, damaged defenders, unstable wreckage, and the recovery wagon. The decision turns on evidence already visible to both people.", "camera": "Slow practical survey, ending on officer.", "movement": "None.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["CINEMATIC_WORLD_BEAT", "OFFICER_EVALUATES_EVIDENCE"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S003_B029",
"speaker_id": "convoy_superior_officer",
"text": "All right. Relay first. Pull the south survivors in and reform on the wagon. Two eyes north at all times.",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 55, "staging": "The ranking officer issues the revised formal order after accepting the tactical argument. Cyanis does not seize command authority.", "camera": "Widen as the order becomes field action.", "movement": "Nearby escorts begin redirecting toward relay and wagon positions.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE", "PURSUIT_ORDER_REVISED", "PROTECTIVE_TACTICAL_COURSE"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S003_B030",
"speaker_id": "cyanis",
"text": "Yes, sir.",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "staging": "Immediate acknowledgment once the order matches the field reality.", "camera": "Medium on Cyanis.", "movement": "Cyanis turns toward the incoming casualty route.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S003_B031",
"speaker_id": "convoy_superior_officer",
"text": "Dovaren.",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 45, "staging": "Cyanis pauses before moving.", "camera": "Two-shot.", "movement": "None.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S003_B032",
"speaker_id": "convoy_superior_officer",
"text": "Next time, give me the field before the refusal.",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 65, "staging": "The officer preserves hierarchy and process without retracting the revised decision.", "camera": "Hold.", "movement": "None.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE", "AUTHORITY_PROCESS_NOTE"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S003_B033",
"speaker_id": "cyanis",
"text": "Fair.",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 110, "staging": "Cyanis accepts the procedural correction without defensiveness. This is not a victory lap.", "camera": "Hold briefly, then release the exchange.", "movement": "Officer turns back toward the wreck line; Cyanis turns toward the casualty route.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"]}
}, {
"beat_id": "S003_B034",
"speaker_id": "",
"text": "",
"left": {},
"right": {},
"active_side": "none",
"advance_mode": "manual",
"cues": {"pause_ms": 260, "staging": "The field begins reorganizing under the revised order. Survivors move into the relay perimeter; escorts reform around the wreck and recovery wagon; north remains watched rather than pursued. No Card response occurs in S003.", "camera": "Wide operational view showing the protective course taking effect.", "movement": "Cyanis moves with the casualty line toward the relay interior and next triage staging area.", "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["CINEMATIC_WORLD_BEAT", "S003_DECISION_EXECUTING"]}
}, {
